1. Definitions

"Work" means everything distributed with this license, including source
code, builds, art, audio, models, designs, documentation and other files,
and any Modified Version of them.

"Modified Version" means the Work with changes, additions or removals,
distributed as a product in its own right.

"Larger Work" means a separate product or service that includes the Work,
or part of it, as a component.

"Source" means the form of the Work preferred for making changes, such as
source code and build files, or layered and project files for art, audio,
models and designs, but not signing keys or passwords.

"Licensor" means the copyright holder or holders of the Work.

"Maintainer" means whoever maintains the original project of the Work,
which is the Licensor unless the Licensor names someone else.

"Charge" means requiring payment of any kind, including money,
cryptocurrency, credits, subscriptions or anything else of value, in exchange
for obtaining, downloading, installing, setting up, accessing, supporting,
customizing or unlocking any part or feature of the Work. Charge also
includes earning revenue from the Work by other means, including
advertising, sponsorships, affiliate or referral fees, or selling or
licensing data collected through the Work.

"Donation" means a payment that is voluntary, is not required to obtain, use
or unlock any part of the Work, and gives the donor nothing in the Work,
including earlier access, that non-donors do not also get at the same time.

